WEBVTT

00:00:02.470 --> 00:00:04.530
I feel real bad...

00:00:04.530 --> 00:00:06.650
Are you okay, Kukuri-chan?

00:00:10.650 --> 00:00:13.420
Kukuri-chan's cute even when she's smashed!

00:00:13.830 --> 00:00:17.360
Pathetic, letting your 
drinking get away from you.

00:00:17.790 --> 00:00:19.610
Now, Taguri...

00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:20.900
Hey!

00:00:21.970 --> 00:00:25.420
A regional goddess has come under assault. 
That's more or less unheard of.

00:00:26.050 --> 00:00:28.600
How are you two planning to deal with this?

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:29.420
Good question...

00:00:30.210 --> 00:00:33.300
For now, I've contacted Takamagahara.

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:35.040
Takamagahara?

00:00:35.040 --> 00:00:35.800
Yes.

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:39.880
They essentially manage the 
gods that govern Japan.

00:00:39.880 --> 00:00:44.310
Wow. So they might send 
another god to come and help?

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:47.060
Sadly, that's not likely.

00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:53.330
Minor deities like myself lose their 
strength if they leave their territory,

00:00:53.330 --> 00:00:55.730
and when one domain has two gods in it,

00:00:55.730 --> 00:01:00.450
it creates a spiritual imbalance 
that causes malison disturbances.

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:05.720
Which would mean more aberrations, 
and even more strain on Kukuri-chan.

00:01:06.140 --> 00:01:10.170
So we can't have Honoka-sama 
come and help, either?

00:01:10.170 --> 00:01:12.340
Do you mean to tell me we're out of options?

00:01:12.340 --> 00:01:13.760
Not at all.

00:01:13.760 --> 00:01:15.150
The gods of this region

00:01:15.150 --> 00:01:18.030
will spare no effort to help, myself included.

00:01:18.030 --> 00:01:22.590
And it sounds like Takamagahara 
sent a message to Tsuzuraden.

00:01:22.590 --> 00:01:26.370
I'm sure they'll send 
someone qualified to help.

00:01:27.300 --> 00:01:32.260
Tsuzuraden... That's where they 
train malison exorcists, right?

00:01:33.420 --> 00:01:35.820
I'm not sure we can expect much from them.

00:01:38.260 --> 00:01:40.240
Who could that be at this hour?

00:01:42.330 --> 00:01:43.620
You two?

00:01:44.110 --> 00:01:46.530
It's good to see you again, Kiriha-sama.

00:01:47.570 --> 00:01:49.380
<b>The power of a regional god.</b>

00:01:49.380 --> 00:01:53.440
<b>Gods who oversee dominions are not able 
to wield their full strength freely.</b>

00:01:53.440 --> 00:01:57.010
<b>This is why they require the 
aid of malison exorcists.</b>

00:02:15.730 --> 00:02:20.070
<b>Tsugumomo</b>

00:02:17.780 --> 00:02:20.070
<b>Tsugu</b>

00:03:26.970 --> 00:03:31.480
m 0 0 l 0 -10 l 10 -10 l 10 0

00:03:26.970 --> 00:03:31.480
m 0 0 l 0 -10 l 10 -10 l 10 0

00:03:26.970 --> 00:03:31.480
<b>Chapter 10</b>

00:03:27.010 --> 00:03:31.470
<b>Revolt</b>

00:03:29.860 --> 00:03:30.820
"Revolt."

00:03:43.590 --> 00:03:44.790
What the...

00:03:44.790 --> 00:03:47.780
Hey, hey, what the heck's going on here?!

00:03:48.230 --> 00:03:50.370
Brother, we're under attack!

00:03:53.120 --> 00:03:55.880
What are these grimy things?!

00:03:56.170 --> 00:03:57.650
Clay from a pottery wheel.

00:03:57.650 --> 00:03:58.500
A pottery wheel?

00:03:58.730 --> 00:04:00.080
That'd be Sanjuurou...

00:04:00.080 --> 00:04:03.300
But he's usually only able to create 
enough clay for a single body!

00:04:05.530 --> 00:04:07.260
Stay on your toes. They're not done.

00:04:09.110 --> 00:04:10.220
Shield Weave.

00:04:13.030 --> 00:04:14.260
There's no end to them...

00:04:14.810 --> 00:04:17.610
Only one of the clay dummies is real.

00:04:18.030 --> 00:04:19.440
Find it. Kill it.

00:04:20.050 --> 00:04:21.890
But Sanjuurou is...

00:04:21.890 --> 00:04:25.860
He's destroyed many of Mayoiga's tsukumogami.

00:04:26.870 --> 00:04:27.780
Mimane!

00:04:28.590 --> 00:04:29.490
Gotcha!

00:04:31.490 --> 00:04:32.370
Found him!

00:04:32.600 --> 00:04:34.800
Four rows from the back, 
seventh from the right!

00:04:47.170 --> 00:04:51.270
Why would Sanjuurou attack us?

00:04:51.730 --> 00:04:54.860
What in the world is happening in Mayoiga?

00:04:54.860 --> 00:04:56.050
Hey!

00:04:56.520 --> 00:04:57.640
Chikage?

00:04:57.640 --> 00:04:58.770
Good work.

00:04:59.150 --> 00:05:00.830
I'm glad you're all okay.

00:05:00.830 --> 00:05:03.200
It's good to see you, too, Chikage-san.

00:05:03.200 --> 00:05:05.280
What's going on around here?

00:05:05.780 --> 00:05:11.010
Well, this guy was the last 
of the troublemakers...

00:05:11.010 --> 00:05:13.220
But you're better off asking 
Old Bowl for the details.

00:05:13.220 --> 00:05:14.910
Chikage!

00:05:16.740 --> 00:05:18.040
We're back, Chikage!

00:05:18.430 --> 00:05:20.180
Hey, there. Good to see you.

00:05:27.800 --> 00:05:30.800
<b>Shared Fate, Shared Dream</b>

00:05:28.850 --> 00:05:30.800
The entire radical group rebelled together?!

00:05:30.800 --> 00:05:36.810
<b>Shared Fate, Shared Dream</b>

00:05:31.020 --> 00:05:31.980
That's right.

00:05:31.980 --> 00:05:34.630
They insisted on attacking the 
regional god as soon as possible

00:05:34.630 --> 00:05:36.810
and would not listen to reason.

00:05:37.020 --> 00:05:40.090
I see. And with Genbu and 
the others having left...

00:05:40.570 --> 00:05:41.590
Indeed.

00:05:41.590 --> 00:05:44.800
Genbu and his group were at 
the center of the radicals,

00:05:44.800 --> 00:05:47.980
and consequently were keeping them in check.

00:05:47.980 --> 00:05:52.200
With their leaders gone, 
the rest decided to run amok.

00:05:52.460 --> 00:05:56.240
But Chikage and the other village 
leaders are among our most powerful.

00:05:56.240 --> 00:06:01.460
The agitators should've known they stood no 
chance, especially without Genbu's group.

00:06:01.460 --> 00:06:05.210
And that is why they committed 
the most forbidden of acts...

00:06:06.390 --> 00:06:08.340
Feeding on humans.

00:06:09.470 --> 00:06:14.830
A tsukumogami gets their strength 
by working for a human.

00:06:14.830 --> 00:06:18.750
But they performed the heretical art 
that involves devouring a human's life,

00:06:18.750 --> 00:06:20.710
man-eating.

00:06:20.710 --> 00:06:24.650
Man-eating tsukumogami gain incredible power,

00:06:24.650 --> 00:06:28.240
but over time, they gradually lose 
their minds, becoming monsters.

00:06:28.550 --> 00:06:33.230
Mayoiga is a gathering of tsukumogami 
who are unable to bear the humans' tyranny.

00:06:33.230 --> 00:06:37.500
But even so, without humans, 
there can be no tsukumogami.

00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:41.530
As such, we are forbidden to defy the 
laws of nature. Do you understand?

00:06:41.530 --> 00:06:42.000
Yes, sir.

00:06:44.170 --> 00:06:48.660
Good. Now, tell me what's 
happened on your end...

00:06:46.380 --> 00:06:49.930
<b>Shared Fate, Shared Dream</b>

00:06:51.130 --> 00:06:54.150
I see. Genbu and the others were killed...

00:06:54.150 --> 00:06:56.900
Weakened or otherwise, 
a regional god is still a god.

00:06:56.900 --> 00:07:01.840
At this point, I doubt the entire 
village would stand any chance.

00:07:02.710 --> 00:07:06.760
And Miurahi-sama's shard will 
only last a month or two more.

00:07:06.760 --> 00:07:08.940
We're running out of time.

00:07:08.940 --> 00:07:14.330
I'd like to consult a fortune 
before deciding what to do next...

00:07:15.300 --> 00:07:18.700
Where is Arumi, anyway? 
Mimane and Azami, as well.

00:07:18.700 --> 00:07:21.080
They weren't killed, were they?!

00:07:22.940 --> 00:07:25.840
They just got a bit muddy 
and headed to the bath.

00:07:23.620 --> 00:07:25.050
I can't believe you!

00:07:26.210 --> 00:07:27.090
Okay—

00:07:28.140 --> 00:07:30.970
Th-The toilet! I just need to use the toilet!

00:07:31.270 --> 00:07:33.760
Release me!

00:07:41.620 --> 00:07:43.840
Mimane can be such a little nuisance.

00:07:43.840 --> 00:07:45.880
I'm glad no one was hurt.

00:07:47.460 --> 00:07:49.780
Hey! Rinse off first!

00:07:53.780 --> 00:07:57.780
Azami, that mound's a 
projection of yours, right?

00:07:57.780 --> 00:07:59.660
You take pretty good care of it.

00:08:00.090 --> 00:08:01.790
Yes. It's important.

00:08:02.510 --> 00:08:04.480
Very important.

00:08:04.480 --> 00:08:07.420
Then I'll help you wash it!

00:08:07.680 --> 00:08:08.550
No need.

00:08:08.550 --> 00:08:11.250
Aw, come on!

00:08:13.410 --> 00:08:15.240
Boing, boing!

00:08:16.010 --> 00:08:16.940
Hands off.

00:08:18.710 --> 00:08:22.910
Then I'll wash you off instead, Azami! 
Would that be okay?

00:08:22.910 --> 00:08:25.060
Well... fine.

00:08:25.630 --> 00:08:27.970
<i>I feel like I should warn her...</i>

00:08:28.320 --> 00:08:31.340
Squish, squish! Rub, rub!

00:08:32.230 --> 00:08:34.930
There you go! Washy-wash!

00:08:32.230 --> 00:08:35.700
That's enough! I'm already clean!

00:08:42.110 --> 00:08:47.960
Oh, dear... I really do need 
to use the toilet now...

00:08:48.240 --> 00:08:51.710
Oh... n-no...

00:08:54.470 --> 00:08:58.970
<b>Tsugu</b>

00:08:54.470 --> 00:08:58.970
<b>Tsugumomo</b>

00:08:56.250 --> 00:08:58.450
<i>Tsugu Tsugumomo</i>.

00:08:56.870 --> 00:08:58.450
<i>Tsugumomo</i>!

00:08:58.970 --> 00:09:03.480
<b>Tsugu</b>

00:08:58.970 --> 00:09:03.480
<b>Tsugumomo</b>

00:09:01.190 --> 00:09:03.080
<i>Tsugu Tsugumomo</i>.

00:09:10.740 --> 00:09:14.240
<i>I always feel refreshed after a full 
day of recuperating from exhaustion.</i>

00:09:20.540 --> 00:09:21.900
Sunao-san?!

00:09:25.230 --> 00:09:26.130
I see.

00:09:26.120 --> 00:09:29.750
<b>Fall Seven Times 
and Rise Up Eight</b>

00:09:26.400 --> 00:09:29.750
So the two of you are here to help out.

00:09:30.040 --> 00:09:33.880
Normally you only get one malison 
exorcist per regional god...

00:09:34.090 --> 00:09:37.660
But the folks at Tsuzuraden 
made emergency arrangements.

00:09:38.850 --> 00:09:42.620
That being the case, we'll be 
staying here for the time being.

00:09:42.620 --> 00:09:43.640
Thank you for having us.

00:09:43.870 --> 00:09:46.130
Wait, you're going to be living here?!

00:09:46.130 --> 00:09:47.020
You got it!

00:09:48.020 --> 00:09:50.120
And that uniform...

00:09:52.520 --> 00:09:57.400
Sumeragi Sunao

00:09:54.070 --> 00:09:55.650
I'm Sumeragi Sunao.

00:09:55.650 --> 00:09:57.400
It's nice to meet you all.

00:09:58.620 --> 00:10:00.880
<i>I'm in the same school as him...</i>

00:10:00.880 --> 00:10:02.260
Say, "Ah!"

00:10:03.670 --> 00:10:05.140
N-Not now...

00:10:07.350 --> 00:10:08.920
Where does he sit?

00:10:10.940 --> 00:10:11.840
Huh?

00:10:12.410 --> 00:10:16.420
Hey! 2-4's supposed to have 
a hot new transfer student!

00:10:16.420 --> 00:10:18.250
And she's legit cute!

00:10:18.250 --> 00:10:19.180
We know.

00:10:19.180 --> 00:10:20.880
So she's in another class?

00:10:20.880 --> 00:10:23.300
Man, talk about a lukewarm response.

00:10:26.290 --> 00:10:29.120
Sumeragi-san seems kind of down.

00:10:29.660 --> 00:10:31.810
Maybe she misses her old school?

00:10:33.610 --> 00:10:36.690
<i>It's not over yet! 
I'll still have plenty of chances!</i>

00:10:36.990 --> 00:10:38.690
And now she's fired up?

00:10:38.690 --> 00:10:41.070
That's the look of someone 
with prey on their mind.

00:10:41.070 --> 00:10:43.330
Troubleshooters'
Office

00:10:42.270 --> 00:10:43.800
What?!

00:10:43.800 --> 00:10:46.580
The beautiful transfer student's 
joining the Troubleshooters' Office?!

00:10:46.860 --> 00:10:48.570
Explain, Kazuya!

00:10:49.100 --> 00:10:52.770
This is Sumeragi Sunao-san. 
She used to go to school in Komiya—

00:10:52.770 --> 00:10:53.840
Not that part!

00:10:54.340 --> 00:10:58.220
I'm asking why in the hell you 
have yet another hot lady friend!

00:10:58.470 --> 00:11:01.220
She's a malison exorcist, too!

00:11:01.650 --> 00:11:04.220
There was actually an attack 
from this place called Mayoiga,

00:11:04.220 --> 00:11:07.220
whose tsukumogami are targeting Kukuri-chan.

00:11:07.600 --> 00:11:10.340
That's why she's here to help.

00:11:10.850 --> 00:11:13.450
I had no idea.

00:11:13.450 --> 00:11:16.770
Then Sumeragi has a tsugumomo, as well?

00:11:16.770 --> 00:11:17.540
Yes.

00:11:23.790 --> 00:11:26.610
I'm the sword tsukumogami, Kotetsu.

00:11:26.610 --> 00:11:28.120
It's nice to meet you.

00:11:28.430 --> 00:11:29.960
Nice to meet you.

00:11:29.960 --> 00:11:32.400
That explains the sudden transfer.

00:11:32.400 --> 00:11:35.680
Must be a drag having to commute 
from the next town over, though.

00:11:35.680 --> 00:11:39.900
Oh, it's not a problem. 
I'm staying at the Kagami house.

00:11:39.900 --> 00:11:41.960
Oh, well, that's a relief!

00:11:42.510 --> 00:11:44.070
How many times, you bastard?!

00:11:44.070 --> 00:11:46.260
How many times are you 
going to hog all the fun?!

00:11:47.100 --> 00:11:49.880
<i>Four women staying at the Kagami house...</i>

00:11:49.880 --> 00:11:51.520
<i>Plus his sister.</i>

00:11:51.930 --> 00:11:54.420
<i>Maybe I should move in, too?</i>

00:11:54.420 --> 00:11:55.920
Let's count your sins!

00:11:55.920 --> 00:11:57.330
It wasn't my idea!

00:11:59.150 --> 00:12:02.280
Cheating
Bastard

00:11:59.150 --> 00:12:02.280
Please do not touch!

00:12:00.470 --> 00:12:01.960
Is this little talk over?

00:12:02.280 --> 00:12:04.800
I need to see you for a sec.

00:12:06.610 --> 00:12:10.660
You know why I called you out here, right?

00:12:11.020 --> 00:12:12.900
No, not at all...

00:12:12.900 --> 00:12:13.970
What?!

00:12:13.970 --> 00:12:17.290
Oh, wait, is this about before?

00:12:17.290 --> 00:12:19.900
The thing about training together?

00:12:19.900 --> 00:12:20.800
Exactly!

00:12:20.800 --> 00:12:21.860
Ow!

00:12:21.860 --> 00:12:28.590
Now apologize for standing me up when 
I spent every single day waiting for you!

00:12:28.590 --> 00:12:29.720
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:12:30.190 --> 00:12:35.230
Granted, you probably would've wussed out 
and not been able to stick with my training!

00:12:35.710 --> 00:12:39.190
But you can't escape now! 
Because... Because...

00:12:39.570 --> 00:12:42.770
Because we live together now!

00:12:42.770 --> 00:12:44.240
Sunao-sama!

00:12:45.300 --> 00:12:46.700
Put your back into it!

00:12:46.700 --> 00:12:48.070
Your footwork is terrible!

00:12:48.280 --> 00:12:49.080
And...

00:12:49.340 --> 00:12:50.580
your defense is weak!

00:12:51.470 --> 00:12:52.080
Well?!

00:12:52.080 --> 00:12:53.750
I admit defeat.

00:12:53.750 --> 00:12:55.730
You've gotten a little bit better,

00:12:55.730 --> 00:12:58.090
but your unarmed martial arts 
still have a long way to go.

00:12:58.090 --> 00:13:02.090
I-I guess so. You're really strong, Sunao-san.

00:13:03.230 --> 00:13:05.660
Honestly, you need to get it together.

00:13:05.660 --> 00:13:08.500
You'll never be able to 
inherit our school otherwise.

00:13:08.500 --> 00:13:09.960
Huh? Inherit?

00:13:10.410 --> 00:13:11.700
That's not what I meant!

00:13:11.700 --> 00:13:14.390
I didn't mean to imply we'd be getting 
married or you'd join my family!

00:13:14.390 --> 00:13:16.810
You just need to shape up, is all!

00:13:17.530 --> 00:13:18.100
Okay...

00:13:18.310 --> 00:13:21.360
Ugh, I can't believe that 
actually made me sweat...

00:13:22.070 --> 00:13:25.530
Anyway, let's spar with 
our tsugumomo this time.

00:13:25.530 --> 00:13:26.610
Where's Kiriha-sama?

00:13:26.610 --> 00:13:30.740
Well, she's been kind of busy lately...

00:13:36.630 --> 00:13:41.060
Um... You could've just 
gone in first, Sunao-san.

00:13:41.060 --> 00:13:45.530
Don't be stupid. Guests shouldn't 
be the first ones in the bath.

00:13:46.180 --> 00:13:49.390
Plus, there are other concerns.

00:13:51.100 --> 00:13:53.860
Staying at the Kagami household?

00:13:53.860 --> 00:13:57.400
Given the circumstances, 
I expect you to fulfill your duty.

00:13:57.400 --> 00:13:58.140
Right!

00:13:58.140 --> 00:14:00.530
This is actually an opportunity.

00:14:01.150 --> 00:14:05.780
<b>Fait accompli
"Established Fact"
When something has happened before
anyone has a chance to protest,
creating a forced state of acceptance</b>

00:14:01.420 --> 00:14:05.780
It's the perfect chance to begin a 
physical relationship with Kazuya-san.

00:14:05.780 --> 00:14:06.900
Mother?!

00:14:06.900 --> 00:14:09.490
If you intend to inherit the 
Sumeragi school of swordplay,

00:14:09.490 --> 00:14:14.040
there's no better partner than someone 
who was able to defeat you in combat.

00:14:14.380 --> 00:14:19.410
This works out for you, as well, 
given your affection for him.

00:14:19.410 --> 00:14:21.700
I-I never said that I...

00:14:21.700 --> 00:14:26.020
Did you think I wouldn't notice 
this photo in your bag?

00:14:27.070 --> 00:14:31.250
Use this chance to grow closer to him.

00:14:31.250 --> 00:14:33.680
You know what will happen if you 
fail to accomplish anything...

00:14:34.940 --> 00:14:36.570
Don't you?

00:14:40.420 --> 00:14:41.790
It was her idea.

00:14:41.790 --> 00:14:43.190
I see.

00:14:43.560 --> 00:14:46.610
Anyway, this is to fool her!

00:14:46.610 --> 00:14:49.150
So we'll bathe together! Okay?

00:14:49.150 --> 00:14:50.320
R-Right!

00:14:50.830 --> 00:14:55.110
Uh, well, I'll wash off now, 
so could you hand me a sponge?

00:14:55.110 --> 00:14:56.580
Oh, right.

00:14:58.490 --> 00:14:59.380
Here.

00:14:59.380 --> 00:15:00.350
Thanks.

00:15:04.570 --> 00:15:05.600
What?!

00:15:05.600 --> 00:15:06.940
Don't look, stupid!

00:15:13.590 --> 00:15:15.190
It's a bit cramped, huh?

00:15:15.190 --> 00:15:16.350
Well, yeah.

00:15:16.810 --> 00:15:20.230
Our house isn't as big as yours...

00:15:20.230 --> 00:15:21.480
Oh, sorry.

00:15:25.910 --> 00:15:26.660
Hey.

00:15:27.500 --> 00:15:30.150
Did something happen with Kiriha-sama?

00:15:30.150 --> 00:15:37.450
Well, when Mayoiga attacked, I gave 
Kiriha-san a command with her real name.

00:15:38.250 --> 00:15:41.750
I promised I wouldn't do it again, 
but she just won't forgive me...

00:15:42.350 --> 00:15:43.850
I don't know what to do.

00:15:44.940 --> 00:15:48.160
That's not all you don't know.

00:15:48.160 --> 00:15:51.010
For instance, you don't 
know why she's really mad.

00:15:51.650 --> 00:15:53.180
You do?! Could you tell me?!

00:15:53.180 --> 00:15:55.280
Keep the blindfold on, stupid!

00:15:57.310 --> 00:16:00.050
Listen. I think Kiriha-sama's problem is...

00:16:01.270 --> 00:16:02.390
Kiriha-san!

00:16:02.940 --> 00:16:04.960
Please, hear me out, Kiriha-san.

00:16:04.960 --> 00:16:05.900
I...

00:16:06.540 --> 00:16:07.340
I want...

00:16:08.850 --> 00:16:12.210
You're the only tsukumogami I want to 
partner with for my entire life, Kiriha-san!

00:16:13.200 --> 00:16:14.290
Huh?!

00:16:14.290 --> 00:16:18.050
I'm sure being treated like a tool came as a

00:16:18.050 --> 00:16:21.040
bigger shock to her than 
being given a command.

00:16:21.040 --> 00:16:24.170
Think about it. Tools can 
be replaced, can't they?

00:16:24.770 --> 00:16:27.120
But I didn't mean to...

00:16:27.120 --> 00:16:32.720
It doesn't matter what you intended, 
dummy, if that's the way she took it.

00:16:33.130 --> 00:16:34.930
What in the world brought this on?!

00:16:35.430 --> 00:16:38.760
Well... there's no one who can replace you.

00:16:39.220 --> 00:16:42.980
You're... the only person like 
you that I know, Kiriha-san.

00:16:43.660 --> 00:16:44.560
So...

00:16:44.560 --> 00:16:46.960
that means you're really important to me!

00:16:50.500 --> 00:16:51.620
Pudding, then.

00:16:52.790 --> 00:16:55.960
Ten richly-smooth puddings from 
Hamachiya, and you'll be absolved.

00:16:56.820 --> 00:16:57.800
Okay!

00:17:00.580 --> 00:17:03.800
All right, time for some tsugumomo sparring.

00:17:03.800 --> 00:17:07.460
Now, we can't have ya getting wiped 
out too bad, so no Divine Possession.

00:17:08.710 --> 00:17:10.890
Ready, and...

00:17:11.830 --> 00:17:12.460
Begin!

00:17:13.010 --> 00:17:13.970
Obi Jab!

00:17:14.950 --> 00:17:16.850
Five?! He could only project three before!

00:17:16.850 --> 00:17:17.970
I can handle that!

00:17:18.600 --> 00:17:20.970
Empty Blade: Four Claws!

00:17:20.970 --> 00:17:22.100
Shield Weave!

00:17:26.430 --> 00:17:27.980
She's faster to strike now.

00:17:28.440 --> 00:17:30.730
And she doesn't leave herself 
open after attacking anymore.

00:17:30.730 --> 00:17:32.480
Four-Point Knife Thrust!

00:17:32.740 --> 00:17:33.790
Secret Sword:

00:17:33.790 --> 00:17:34.740
Wing Blade!

00:17:39.370 --> 00:17:41.780
Holy cow!

00:17:44.170 --> 00:17:45.750
Very nice, you two!

00:17:46.140 --> 00:17:48.180
You're nothing like you were before.

00:17:48.180 --> 00:17:49.780
Thank you very much.

00:17:49.780 --> 00:17:52.050
The two of you have improved a lot, as well.

00:17:52.050 --> 00:17:54.130
You done real good to come this far!

00:17:54.130 --> 00:17:55.760
Seems like we got some reliable help.

00:17:56.550 --> 00:17:59.010
I'd still say we've got the edge.

00:17:59.010 --> 00:18:01.760
Oh, we'll surpass you in no time.

00:18:01.760 --> 00:18:02.780
Sunao-san!

00:18:04.390 --> 00:18:07.920
Thank you so much for 
helping me with Kiriha-san!

00:18:09.150 --> 00:18:13.530
You don't need to thank me. You helped 
me with Kotetsu before, remember?

00:18:13.530 --> 00:18:14.780
Sunao-san...

00:18:15.090 --> 00:18:17.800
You know, Sunao-san, when I think of you...

00:18:18.860 --> 00:18:20.810
<i>Wait, is he...</i>

00:18:20.810 --> 00:18:22.530
I couldn't ask for a better friend!

00:18:26.260 --> 00:18:28.410
Um, Sunao-san?

00:18:28.900 --> 00:18:31.890
What's with you two? Did you have a fight?

00:18:31.890 --> 00:18:33.840
I really don't know.

00:18:33.840 --> 00:18:35.800
You have to help me, Kiriha-san!

00:18:36.930 --> 00:18:38.860
You've gotta know something, Kiriha-san!

00:18:38.860 --> 00:18:40.650
Cease your pestering.

00:18:40.650 --> 00:18:42.320
Kiriha-san, please!

00:18:42.320 --> 00:18:43.940
You're pitiful.

00:18:49.290 --> 00:18:53.690
Thanks for helping us, 
Ashimine-kun, Mimane-chan.

00:18:53.690 --> 00:18:55.610
Don't sweat it!

00:18:57.310 --> 00:19:00.560
What will you do when that 
flute tsukumogami is revived?

00:19:01.070 --> 00:19:03.530
Torture answers out of her?

00:19:03.530 --> 00:19:06.160
Of course not. I'd never do that.

00:19:06.700 --> 00:19:09.160
It's true that we could use answers,

00:19:09.160 --> 00:19:11.720
but I don't think forcing it is a good idea.

00:19:12.740 --> 00:19:15.840
I asked Kukuri-chan about it, 
and apparently Mayoiga is

00:19:15.840 --> 00:19:20.120
where a bunch of tsukumogami who had 
terrible human partners have gathered.

00:19:20.120 --> 00:19:23.970
She might've been treated 
poorly by humans, too.

00:19:24.660 --> 00:19:28.730
If she does wake up, I'd like 
to find her a good partner.

00:19:29.340 --> 00:19:31.980
Do you think you'll actually be able to?

00:19:32.310 --> 00:19:37.940
Probably not by myself, but if I ask the 
other exorcists and the gods for help...

00:19:37.940 --> 00:19:44.080
Maybe we can find good partners for all 
tsukumogami in Mayoiga, not just her.

00:19:44.080 --> 00:19:48.300
Then they wouldn't have 
to fight the gods, right?

00:19:50.470 --> 00:19:53.010
<i>Tsukumogami and humans can't coexist.</i>

00:19:53.010 --> 00:19:56.380
<i>I've seen proof enough 
of that, for centuries.</i>

00:19:57.410 --> 00:19:58.860
<i>He's just being naïve.</i>

00:19:59.740 --> 00:20:00.730
Brother.

00:20:01.820 --> 00:20:04.010
Old Bowl is calling for everyone.

00:20:04.010 --> 00:20:04.970
All right.

00:20:06.190 --> 00:20:11.640
To decide on how to deal with things going 
forward, I've had Arumi read a fortune.

00:20:12.090 --> 00:20:16.260
And what she saw was two shards.

00:20:16.260 --> 00:20:17.650
Two of them?

00:20:17.650 --> 00:20:21.990
With that as a sign, 
I've come to a decision.

00:20:21.990 --> 00:20:24.900
Please come out, Miurahi-sama.

00:20:28.140 --> 00:20:29.910
This is the first time 
I'm meeting some of you.

00:20:30.530 --> 00:20:33.920
Given how long I've been 
asleep, that's only natural.

00:20:34.510 --> 00:20:36.770
So allow me to introduce myself.

00:20:36.770 --> 00:20:40.570
I am Miurahi, the tsukumogami of Mayoiga.

00:20:40.570 --> 00:20:43.450
Old Bowl has brought me up 
to date on what has transpired.

00:20:43.980 --> 00:20:48.050
My failings have caused you 
all a great deal of trouble.

00:20:48.700 --> 00:20:50.050
I'm sorry.

00:20:50.050 --> 00:20:53.060
Come now, there's no need 
for that, Miurahi-sama!

00:20:53.300 --> 00:20:57.580
I'm more worried about how the shard 
goes out of control when you're awake.

00:20:57.580 --> 00:20:58.820
Are you okay?

00:20:59.250 --> 00:21:04.510
Yes. The shard has lost the majority 
of its power, compared to before.

00:21:04.510 --> 00:21:06.160
I can control it now.

00:21:06.850 --> 00:21:08.320
As ironic as that is...

00:21:08.780 --> 00:21:14.130
Before we discuss this matter, 
waking Miurahi-sama was my decision.

00:21:14.130 --> 00:21:19.710
And I did so because I believe we 
no longer have the luxury of waiting.

00:21:20.610 --> 00:21:23.350
The two shards shone in the crystal ball...

00:21:23.350 --> 00:21:27.450
I believe it speaks to a confrontation between 
Miurahi-sama and the regional goddess,

00:21:27.450 --> 00:21:29.720
each with their own shard.

00:21:31.470 --> 00:21:34.000
Then you wanted a meeting about...

00:21:35.100 --> 00:21:39.610
Mayoiga is going to attack 
the land of the goddess.

00:21:40.510 --> 00:21:45.610
We will eliminate any resident 
gods and malison exorcists.

00:21:46.230 --> 00:21:49.100
And I will defeat the regional goddess.

00:23:19.960 --> 00:23:32.970
<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

00:23:20.330 --> 00:23:22.690
A giant ship comes floating 
in from the mountains.

00:23:22.690 --> 00:23:26.380
The tsukumogami of Mayoiga have 
come at us with an all-out attack.

00:23:26.380 --> 00:23:29.470
The final battle begins on the 
grounds of Hakusan Shrine.

00:23:29.470 --> 00:23:32.970
Next time on <i>Tsugu Tsugumomo</i>, 
Chapter 11: "Total War."

00:23:29.470 --> 00:23:32.970
<b>Total War</b>

00:23:32.970 --> 00:23:34.050
Don't miss it!

00:23:32.970 --> 00:23:34.970
<b>Don't miss it!</b>

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:40.250
<b>Illustration by: Konogi Yoshiru</b>
